        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Based on <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1140067250\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/15006\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/15006/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/15006\">#15006</a>.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds the <code class=\"notranslate\">abort</code> event on <code class=\"notranslate\">IDBDatabase</code>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The data was originally removed in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1140067250\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/15006\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/15006/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/15006\">#15006</a>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #15345.\">Fixes</span>: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1166786936\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/15345\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/15345/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/15345\">#15345</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27167",
            "title": "Re-add IDBDatabase abort event",
            "date_modified": "2025-06-27T14:13:37.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-06-27T14:00:35.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "caugner",
                "url": "https://github.com/caugner"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fixes several spec URLs.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Accounts for:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Features removed from the spec (implies setting <code class=\"notranslate\">deprecated: true</code>).</li>\n<li>Features moved within a spec (i.e. different id).</li>\n<li>Features moved to another spec.</li>\n<li>Feature sections renamed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Changes some spec URLs to draft, because webref/ed does not contain ids from TRs.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Extracted from: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2431920257\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/23958\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/23958/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/23958\">#23958</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27164",
            "title": "Fix several spec URLs",
            "date_modified": "2025-06-27T11:55:10.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-06-27T11:54:16.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "caugner",
                "url": "https://github.com/caugner"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16889642?u=a501a637a8896108e5a550460822585474ee055b&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add \"labeled values support\" entry of input[type=\"range\"]</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Safari can't render the options content of input[type=\"range\"]  so far.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">So add a new sub-feature to describe it.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #24782.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2604711557\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24782\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24782/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24782\">#24782</a></p>",
