        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103469166?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The read() method of ReadableStreamBYOBReader was introduced in Chrome 89, but the options.min parameter was not fully supported until Chrome 140.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This change marks full support for options.min parameter in 140. Also mirrors this change to Edge and Chrome for Android.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>",
